+# Full study: Erdős 1048 diameter variant
+
+The frozen statement concerns a monic complex polynomial whose roots lie in a
+radius interval `1/2 < r ≤ (√5 - 1)/2`; its claim is a lower bound on the
+extended diameter of the connected component of the level set containing zero.
+The provider record is statement-only (`sorryAx` in the source), so this
+package does not treat that source proof as evidence. It instead records an
+independent claim-owned transport kernel and a complete evidence ledger for
+canonical replay.
+
+The semantic crosswalk binds provider, revision, module, path, file bytes,
+declaration text, declaration type, elaborated source/target expressions and
+the transitive declaration census. Shadowing and substitution sets are empty.
+The readable reconstruction is injective over source binding, statement,
+transport, machine root, dependencies, cold replay, mutation suite and release
+decision. The release is provisional until Master recomputes Lean objects and
+accepts the integrated bytes.
